      "writtenOn": "2024-04-23T23:44:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Running `rts54_post_command()` will also call `call_cci_event_cb()` when the command completes.   That may cause problems in the pdc_power_mgmt.c module.\n\nI haven\u0027t reviewed the full CL stack.  How is synchronization between pdc_power_mgmt.c and the ucsi/rts54xx.c driver managed?\n\nAs Sam notes, `public_api_block` in pdc_power_mgmt.c is already setup to generate a blocking PDC command.",
      "parentUuid": "094ace23_65806ca1",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2176,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 2200,
        "endChar": 11
      },
      "revId": "7c9609de413b1fe6ff47f1be5365ca5234077b6b",
